  {
   "name": "Risk: hot tenant",
   "tone": "risk",
   "summary": "One key with a huge share of the traffic overloads its shard; adding shards doesn't help because a key lives on exactly one.",
   "steps": [
    {
     "text": "A celebrity or a giant tenant sends 40% of all requests, all with the same shard key.",
